  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for artists, culture professionals and living heritage bearers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The war in Ukraine has had massive repercussions on the Ukrainian cultural and creative industries. According to the National Council for the Recovery of Ukraine, State and local funding for culture has been drastically reduced, notably causing a brain drain . Cultural institutions thus cannot rely on State support at the moment, and their survival depends on new connections and partnerships, notably at the international level, taking stock of the growing interest in Ukrainian culture around the world.</narrative>
  </description>
